  "scenes": [
    {
      "text": "What if Naruto's shadow clones went on strike? Congratulations, bro got canceled by his own unpaid staff.",
      "label": "THE CLONES HAVE DEMANDS",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.122448957655752,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-clones",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto multiplying through shadow clone technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this alternate timeline, two hundred Narutos cross their arms. Same face. Same trauma. Terrifying customer service department.",
      "label": "TWO HUNDRED IDENTICAL COMPLAINTS",
      "start": 6.122448957655752,
      "end": 13.465948128776557,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-clones",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto multiplying through shadow clone technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He says, we're literally the same person. Exactly, boss. We know you were about to volunteer us again.",
      "label": "THE ORIGINAL IS CONFUSED",
      "start": 13.465948128776557,
      "end": 18.539325776272193,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rasengan practice stops. Missions fall behind. Suddenly the village discovers its entire productivity plan was one exhausted teenager.",
      "label": "TRAINING IS NOW DELAYED",
      "start": 18.539325776272193,
      "end": 26.157991192680896,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-train",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto practicing a technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Kakashi looks up from his book. My guy has never seen a meeting this aggressively orange before.",
      "label": "MANAGEMENT HAS LOGGED OFF",
      "start": 26.157991192680896,
      "end": 30.99059837554962,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-kakashi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Kakashi observing training; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-kakashi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Kakashi observing training; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The clones explain their real complaint: every painful training memory comes back to Naruto. He's exploiting himself with extra steps.",
      "label": "MEMORIES COME BACK TOO",
      "start": 30.99059837554962,
      "end": 38.16211864336549,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-clones",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto multiplying through shadow clone technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So he proposes shorter rotations and actual breaks. Look at that. Character development with a lunch schedule attached.",
      "label": "AN ACTUAL CONCESSION",
      "start": 38.16211864336549,
      "end": 44.23297393002976,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of flooding every problem with bodies, smaller clone squads test strategies and report what actually worked first.",
      "label": "SMALLER SQUAD SMARTER PLAN",
      "start": 44.23297393002976,
      "end": 50.32102710702453,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-train",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto practicing a technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That doesn't create free chakra. They still split his supply. This union negotiates breaks, not a physics refund.",
      "label": "THEY STILL SHARE CHAKRA",
      "start": 50.32102710702453,
      "end": 56.30589294203632,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-clones",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto multiplying through shadow clone technique; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now opponents face coordinated scouts and decoys instead of a thousand orange dudes arguing over who gets punched.",
      "label": "THE ENEMY MEETS A TEAM",
      "start": 56.30589294203632,
      "end": 62.39394611903109,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-kakashi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Kakashi observing training; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-kakashi",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Kakashi observing training; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One clone asks who elected the original leader. Mother father. The confidence just left his entire forehead.",
      "label": "WHO APPROVED THE LEADER",
      "start": 62.39394611903109,
      "end": 68.0864478184245,
      "shots": [
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        },
        {
          "asset": "ifverse-anime-naruto-clone-strike-01-naruto",
          "fit": "contain",
          "trim_start": 0,
          "match_reason": "Naruto reacting to a disagreement; illustrates this narrated character/action in an invented scenario, not a literal canon event."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Naruto joins the strike. The clones cheer. Konoha's biggest labor dispute ends with everyone demanding ramen from the same wallet.",
      "label": "THE BOSS JOINS THE PICKET",
      "start": 68.0864478184245,
      "end": 75.0,
