      "end": 7.5,
      "text": "In this alternate timeline, two"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.5,
      "end": 9.6,
      "text": "hundred Narutos cross their arms."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.6,
      "end": 10.76,
      "text": "Same face."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.76,
      "end": 11.62,
      "text": "Same trauma."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.62,
      "end": 13.52,
      "text": "Terrifying customer service department."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.52,
      "end": 14.5,
      "text": "He says, we're literally the"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.5,
      "end": 15.56,
      "text": "same person."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.56,
      "end": 17.32,
      "text": "Exactly, boss. We know you were about"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.32,
      "end": 18.539325776272193,
      "text": "to volunteer us again."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.539325776272193,
      "end": 20.2593125,
      "text": "Rasengan practice stops."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.2593125,
      "end": 21.6193125,
      "text": "Missions fall behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.6193125,
      "end": 23.019312499999998,
      "text": "Suddenly the village discovers its"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.019312499999998,
      "end": 24.7993125,
      "text": "entire productivity plan was one"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.7993125,
      "end": 26.179312499999998,
      "text": "exhausted teenager."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.179312499999998,
      "end": 27.1393125,
      "text": "Kakashi looks up from his"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.1393125,
      "end": 27.8993125,
      "text": "book."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.8993125,
      "end": 28.8393125,
      "text": "My guy has never seen"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.8393125,
      "end": 30.2993125,
      "text": "a meeting this aggressively orange"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.2993125,
      "end": 31.0393125,
      "text": "before."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.0393125,
      "end": 32.2993125,
      "text": "The clones explain their real"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.2993125,
      "end": 34.4393125,
      "text": "complaint: every painful training memory"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.4393125,
      "end": 36.1993125,
      "text": "comes back to Naruto."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.1993125,
      "end": 37.4793125,
      "text": "He's exploiting himself with extra"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.4793125,
      "end": 38.16211864336549,
      "text": "steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.16211864336549,
      "end": 39.742124999999994,
      "text": "So he proposes shorter rotations"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.742124999999994,
      "end": 41.162124999999996,
      "text": "and actual breaks."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.162124999999996,
      "end": 41.902125,
      "text": "Look at that."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.902125,
      "end": 43.102125,
      "text": "Character development with a lunch"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.102125,
      "end": 44.262125,
      "text": "schedule attached."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.262125,
      "end": 45.462125,
      "text": "Instead of flooding every problem"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.462125,
      "end": 47.28212499999999,
      "text": "with bodies, smaller clone squads"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.28212499999999,
      "end": 49.142125,
      "text": "test strategies and report what"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.142125,
      "end": 50.342124999999996,
      "text": "actually worked first."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.342124999999996,
      "end": 52.002125,
      "text": "That doesn't create free chakra."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.002125,
      "end": 53.562124999999995,
      "text": "They still split his supply."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.562124999999995,
      "end": 55.342124999999996,
      "text": "This union negotiates breaks, not"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.342124999999996,
      "end": 56.30589294203632,
      "text": "a physics refund."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.30589294203632,
      "end": 58.025875,
      "text": "Now opponents face coordinated scouts"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.025875,
      "end": 59.585875,
      "text": "and decoys instead of a"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.585875,
      "end": 61.485875,
      "text": "thousand orange dudes arguing over"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.485875,
      "end": 62.505875,
      "text": "who gets punched."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.505875,
      "end": 63.545875,
      "text": "One clone asks who elected"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.545875,
      "end": 64.945875,
      "text": "the original leader."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.945875,
      "end": 65.825875,
      "text": "Mother father."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.825875,
      "end": 67.065875,
      "text": "The confidence just left his"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.065875,
      "end": 68.145875,
      "text": "entire forehead."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.145875,
      "end": 69.725875,
      "text": "Naruto joins the strike."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.725875,
      "end": 71.005875,
      "text": "The clones cheer."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.005875,
      "end": 72.525875,
      "text": "Konoha's biggest labor dispute ends"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.525875,
      "end": 74.165875,
      "text": "with everyone demanding ramen from"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.165875,
      "end": 74.965875,
      "text": "the same wallet."
    }
  ]
}
